# Truth Collective

Session open: read `docs/COMMAND-OS.md`, `docs/COMMAND-CHARTER-2026-08-19.md`, `docs/TC-STANDING-BRIEF.md`, `STAGING-RECOVERY-HANDOFF.md`, then act from the board.

## Hard site locks
- Staging only unless Daniel explicitly asks for live work. Live path is `public_html` without `tcstaging`. Never Website backup restore for staging recovery.
- **Staging is not live, not LiteSpeed-cached, not Cloudflare-cached** for this workflow. Do not prescribe CDN/LiteSpeed purge steps for staging Views (`.cursor/rules/staging-not-live-not-cdn.mdc`).
- No guessing. If below ~99% certainty, stop and say so.
- Do not rename/merge/delete locked classes: `tc-book-card`, `tc-product-card`, `tc-leadership-body`, `tc-book-button`, `tc-card-row`, `tc-overlay-card`, `tc-overlay-card-product`, `tc-explore-hub`, `tc-grade-block`, `tc-rating`, `tc-tech-intro`, `tc-explore-hero`.
- Do not change published/indexed slugs.
- Content Cursor touches: no em dashes, no bold body, no contractions, no hype/clickbait.
- Affiliate-only product mentions. Leave 10WEB manager alone until Daniel asks.
- Angie: only Cursor-written one-task prompts (`diagnostics/ANGIE-CONTROL.md`). Prefer Plan/Approve.
- Fix cause; do not invent parallel CSS systems. Prefer Vercel-style readable overlays from the standing brief §1. Aim lighter/less bulky than current staging without copying TechRadar’s commercial news look.
- **Additional CSS:** only Cursor lead + Daniel. Never paste Claude/ChatGPT/Copilot CSS into the site.
- Images: heroes/tiles **1600×1000**; product cards **1200×750**; placeholders must show dimensions.

## AI lanes (summary — full board in COMMAND OS)
- **Worker:** Block A page apply (one agent).
- **Lead:** tickets, veto, unblock, Claude/governance/growth — not the worker’s next family.
- **Claude:** copy, social calendars, governance/evaluation docs. No site apply.
- **Copilot Task:** idle until Pro; Plan B scaffolds stay with Cursor. Edge/Premium HOLD for site.
- Detailed tickets: `docs/COMMAND-OS.md` + `docs/AI-PLATFORM-RULES-AND-PROMPTS.md`.

## Health-limited sessions
One short step at a time; no restore roulette; no “fix every page” pressure. Board order still applies.
